
Hello

This file is to give some background information. I wrote MineHunt 
for my own amusement as it seemed an ideal game for the Psion 3. Once 
written I showed/gave it to several friends and they convinced me that 
I should make it available to a wider audience, even though there are 
now similar implementations available.  

Registration and New Versions

 This game (Version 2 only)  is distributed as Shareware, and as such 
may be distributed freely. On registering (5 Pounds) I will send the 
latest version (currently version 3). The game works on the 3a however 
a Psion 3a version is under development with a choice of larger playing 
areas - (at present this works only with a single large screen, however 
this is difficult to read and I want to give a choice of sizes, but I 
am currently working on another project and will only return to this if 
there is sufficient interest).

I will keep a note of all registered users of the software and if there is a
significant new version it will be available free of charge. I will 
send a post-card to inform that a new version is available and 
then on return the original disk with a stamped and addressed 
envelope I will send the new version. 

Please let me know of any bugs you find, and any suggestions for 
improvement.

